Subject: [PATCH 1/3] [compiler] Peel loops with terminal throw paths

Copy bounded terminal side paths with the peeled iteration, including
 their effects and deoptimization frame states. Reject external control
predecessors and nonterminal escapes, preserving marked exits for paths
that continue outside the loop.

